questions.question_es:
Suponiendo que la variable de entorno REGION no está definida antes de lanzar pytest, ¿qué informa esta suite?

```python
import os

def region():
    return os.environ.get("REGION", "eu-west-1")

def test_region(monkeypatch):
    monkeypatch.setenv("REGION", "us-east-1")
    assert region() == "us-east-1"

def test_por_defecto():
    assert region() == "eu-west-1"
```

questions.question_en:
